#: opts-page/global-options.php:51
msgid ""
"Custom filters: The plugin cache is for the latest posts and comments "
"retrieved by the plugin by default. To provide your own results before the "
"plugin retrieves the latest comments, use ntb_pre_get_recent_comments. For "
"the latest posts, use ntb_pre_get_recent_posts. Results provided through "
"these filters do not use the plugin cache. If you want to cache them, create "
"your own cache and invalidate it when your data changes. The legacy "
"ntb_filter_get_all_recent_comments and ntb_filter_get_all_recent_posts "
"filters also bypass the plugin cache. If you use "
"ntb_filter_get_all_recent_comments to replace the plugin results with your "
"own, we recommend switching to ntb_pre_get_recent_comments. For posts, "
"replace ntb_filter_get_all_recent_posts with ntb_pre_get_recent_posts."
msgstr ""

